{
    "schema_version": "1.0",
    "pm": "composer",
    "lockfile": "composer.lock",
    "pattern": "p3-combined",
    "patterns_exercised": ["metapackage", "multiple-version-constraints", "stability-flag"],
    "notes": "Three P3 patterns combined in one project. (1) sentry/sdk 4.0.0 is a genuine type:metapackage on Packagist with no code — it only requires sentry/sentry ^4.0. Mend must include the metapackage node itself AND its transitive sentry/sentry child. (2) monolog/monolog is constrained as '^2.0 || ^3.0'; Composer resolves exactly one version (3.10.0 on PHP 8.3) — Mend must report one entry, not two. (3) minimum-stability is 'stable' with prefer-stable:true, but nesbot/carbon carries an @beta per-package stability flag (stability-flags: {nesbot/carbon: 10} in the lockfile). Composer resolved carbon to 2.73.0 (a stable release) despite the @beta flag; Mend must not drop or duplicate this package.",
